      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this will be part of their economy they want to introduce at some point.\nBut yeah, I personally would like that feature as well, since whenever I am doing something for a very dear friend of mine, i have to log in into her account and upload it there. Having a simple \"shared\" avatar feature would lower the amount of avatars i would have to upload as well as the space it will use on your servers.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
