        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had a similar idea for commissions, but the uploader instead uploads on behalf of the recipient, and it goes into a pending state that the recipient can review, and then allow or reject.\nWhitelisting like this is interesting and useful, but could also allow a disgruntled ex or artist to abuse people on the whitelist.  Don't hang out with the artist, or commission them enough?  Boom, access pulled.\nAlso, it would take up a favorites slot, and those are very limited unless you have VRC+.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
