  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-27T21:47:59.211Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sharing private avatars to only certain users E.g.(commissions), You would have the ability to change which users are able to use a private avatar.\nAvatar makers would be able to change who can use the private avatar via the website when inspecting an avatar and when uploading.\n\n(This may have already been requested)\nMockup for this is in the image below\n\n*",
